    "text": "By Lavonia Anderson ,\n1 days ago CANBY, OR — A 31-year-old man is facing a manslaughter charge after police say he hit a 13-year-old girl riding an electric scooter in Canby and drove away. The crash happened Wednesday night near the 300 block of South Ivy Street, and the girl later died at a Portland hospital. Read full article",
